# Copyright & comments (web)

When creating or editing files under `src/`:

1. **Copyright** — Start with the block in [docs/standards/web-code.md](../../docs/standards/web-code.md) § Copyright header (TypeScript block comment; same for CSS).
2. **Comments** — Code shows *what*; comments explain *why* (auth, work scope, live API, backup/restore). JSDoc on exported hooks, API helpers, and reusable UI in `core/`.
3. **Avoid** — Commented-out code, JSX narration, lint/`any` without a one-line reason.

Run `npm run lint` after substantive edits.
